## Why This Is Asked
Examination of asynchronous post-payment work and data consistency across services.

## Key Concepts
- End-to-end orchestration with a payment gateway and an async rewards service
- Idempotent checkout and idempotency keys
- Eventual consistency via polling or webhook retries
- Service mocks to deterministically reproduce success/failure
- Data isolation per tenant and quota edge cases

